  "guidance": "2019 GAAP: sales about $8.4bn, income from operations about $900m, EPS $3.00-$3.20, EBITDA about $1.3bn (D&A ~$0.4bn); net income $530-565m. 2019 adjusted: sales about $8.4bn, adjusted EBITDA about $1.6bn, adjusted income from operations about $1.2bn, adjusted EPS $4.00-$4.20 (excl. GE Transportation one-time transaction costs, one-time PPA, non-cash accounting harmonization); adjusted op margin about 14%; ETR about 24%; adjusted CFO to exceed adjusted net income; adjusted net income $710-740m. Pro forma full-year with GE Transportation: sales about $9.2bn, adj. EBITDA about $1.7bn, adj. op income about $1.4bn.",
